    ("Within how many calendar days must the Consignee generate the CRAC on GeM after physical receipt of goods?", "Within 10 days of delivery", ["Within 30 days of delivery", "Within 45 days of delivery", "Within 2 days of delivery"], "GeM policy mandates CRAC generation within 10 days; if not acted upon, auto-CRAC is triggered by the system to protect sellers."),
