    ("Who is the legal governing entity that owns and operates the Government e-Marketplace?", "GeM SPV (Special Purpose Vehicle, a Section 8 non-profit company under the Ministry of Commerce and Industry)", ["A private foreign multinational retail corporation", "The Confederation of Indian Industry (CII)", "A commercial consortium of private credit card banks"], "GeM SPV is a 100% government-owned Special Purpose Vehicle set up to manage, innovate, and administer the national portal."),
