    ("Can a Reseller sell products on GeM without the authorization of the Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM)?", "No, for categorized catalog products, valid OEM authorization is required to ensure genuine supply and warranty", ["Yes, anyone can sell any trademarked goods freely", "Only if the reseller is a foreign company", "Only during government holiday weekends"], "OEM authorization protects government buyers against counterfeit items, refurbished goods, and unserviced warranty claims."),
